              "text": "Customer shall indemnify Vendor against any third-party claim to the extent arising out of content or materials provided by Customer for use in the Services or Customer's breach of Applicable Law.",
              "numbering": "20.3"
            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0075",
              "text": "The indemnified party shall give the indemnifying party prompt written notice of the claim, allow the indemnifying party to control the defence, and provide reasonable cooperation.",
