              "text": "If the Services or Deliverables become the subject of an infringement claim, Vendor shall procure the right for Customer to continue using them, or modify or replace them with functionally equivalent, non-infringing items; if none of those remedies is reasonably available, Vendor shall refund prepaid Fees for the affected Services and Deliverables.",
